        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right, though the browser held the cookie."
      },
      {
        "text": "An error, because cookies are blocked in tests",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Cookies work in tests."
      },
      {
        "text": "`sid=` with the value masked",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Nothing is masked; nothing is shown."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ex-xm1g4q28",
    "version": 1,
    "section": "what-a-script-sees",
    "type": "quiz",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "drillable": true,
    "prompt": "The local-storage test copies a token into the page's title. Why is that witness enough?",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "Because the title is sent to the server",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It is not."
      },
      {
        "text": "It is not enough; only a real attack proves it",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "A real attack proves nothing more."
      },
      {
        "text": "Whoever copies it there sends it anywhere",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. Reading it is the whole of the flaw."
      },
      {
        "text": "Because titles cannot hold tokens",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "This one did."
      }
    ]
  },
